    "body": "Hello @MeetGandhi, thanks for you issue!\n\nHave you tried:\n```python\nimport pennylane as qml\nfrom squlearn import Executor\n\nexecutor = Executor(qml.device(\"lightning.gpu\"))\n```\n\nIn general, the Executor can be intialized with Qiskit backends or PennyLane devices not only strings.\nWe have tested this with different PennyLane devices, but we never tried the GPU implementation. ",
