    "body": "The suggested approach Executor(qml.device(\"lightning.gpu\")) causes an initialization error:\n**[Line:65][Method:refresh]: Error in PennyLane Lightning: initialization error**\n\nEnvironment:\n- PennyLane Lightning GPU works fine when used directly with QNodes.\n- Error only occurs when passing a GPU device to squlearn's Executor.\n\nCode that fails:\ngpu_device = qml.device(\"lightning.gpu\", wires=4)  # Works fine\nexecutor = Executor(gpu_device)  # Causes initialization error\n\nIt seems like an incompatibility between Squlearn's Executor and PennyLane Lightning GPU backend. Do you have any suggestions for a workaround?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
