    "created_at": "2025-08-01T12:06:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-08-01T12:10:04Z",
    "body": "I've made a few minor changes in PR #341 to address some issues.\nHowever, I believe the main problem is that we currently don't support the latest update of PennyLane, as it introduced some major changes to the API.\n\nAs a temporary workaround, you can try installing the previous version of PennyLane:\n```\npip install pennylane==0.41.1\npip install pennylane-lightning[gpu]==0.41.1\n```\nThe overall performance is better if you use\n\n```\ngpu_device = qml.device(\"lightning.gpu\") # Without the wires!\nexecutor = Executor(gpu_device)\n```",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
